flowchart TD
  Charge[Charge the card] --> Approved{Provider approved?}
  Approved -->|yes| Saved[Save payment]
  Approved -->|no| Retryable{Retryable failure?}
  Retryable -->|yes| Wait[Wait with backoff]
  Wait --> Charge
  Retryable -->|no| Release[Release stock reservation]
  Release --> Another[Ask for another payment method]
